@ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5129

### Health checks
GET {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Usuários
GET {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria.silva@example.com",
  "role": "Tutor",
  "phone": "(11) 99999-0000"
}

### Pets
GET {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Accept: application/json

### Consultas
GET {{ClyvoVetApi_HostAddress}}/api/consultations
Accept: application/json
